Boundary notes:
  ad-fs = on-premises federation services: claims-based auth, SAML 2.0, WS-Federation,
  OAuth 2.0/OIDC, claims rules, relying party trusts, WAP, certificate management, migration
  to Entra ID. AD FS authenticates against AD DS (route Kerberos/replication to ad-ds).
  AD FS uses certificates from AD CS (route PKI and ESC vulnerabilities to ad-cs).
  Entra ID is the recommended replacement for AD FS (route new federation design to entra-id).
  Token-signing certificate private keys and service account credentials route to
  secrets-hygiene.

